{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distant future. The world is run by megacorporations, crises end to be followed by another one. To reign in the growing social tension a decision was made to reanimate a long forgotten form of entertainment, the gladiator fights. Ancient traditions enhanced by hi-tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the gladiators lucky enough to join NCORE. What awaits you on the way to glory?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic PvPvE fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/extras/ba15c8c42d9e607c259e21c816bd6768.poster.avif?t=1770623091\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/extras/ba15c8c42d9e607c259e21c816bd6768.webm?t=1770623091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/extras/ba15c8c42d9e607c259e21c816bd6768.mp4?t=1770623091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies are the sentries of the arena, bloodthirsty gladiators, and mighty bosses. Be daring and aggressive or cunning and careful \u2013 choose your own combat style but remember that in NCORE a hunter can become prey at any moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A changing multi-arena</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/extras/c696c541d11f94535160fcc29b8d3e79.poster.avif?t=1770623091\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/extras/c696c541d11f94535160fcc29b8d3e79.webm?t=1770623091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/extras/c696c541d11f94535160fcc29b8d3e79.mp4?t=1770623091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your arena is not the old Coliseum but a Hexadrome, a technological marvel where every Hex is a unique world. Military bases, medieval castles, cities ravaged by a zombie apocalypse \u2013 choose your path, travel between the locations, and adapt to a new reality each time the arena re-builds itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Transforming weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/extras/d92e282c2bb4a2044bd2a1a3778d8e2e.poster.avif?t=1770623091\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/extras/d92e282c2bb4a2044bd2a1a3778d8e2e.webm?t=1770623091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/extras/d92e282c2bb4a2044bd2a1a3778d8e2e.mp4?t=1770623091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your arsenal is the peak of technology. Weapons transform from long-ranged to melee in a blink \u2013 from a rifle to a mace, shotgun to sword, pistol to claws. Use each mode strategically to dominate the arena.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Teamwork</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/extras/726895c3b95746ed802f60401da4874b.poster.avif?t=1770623091\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/extras/726895c3b95746ed802f60401da4874b.webm?t=1770623091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/extras/726895c3b95746ed802f60401da4874b.mp4?t=1770623091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join teams of up to three gladiators and act as a unit, or split up and rely on each other\u2019s mastery. Be flexible in your tactics, crash your opponents, and lead your team to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join NCORE. Test the futuristic arena and become the hero worthy of their own legend!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3307770?t=1770623091","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/70f2f4769a69a853376c2d7261a0a0a1a81b2805/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770623091","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/3afea269edd297f3df8afd4c4df5c2d28bb23e6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770623091","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/3afea269edd297f3df8afd4c4df5c2d28bb23e6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770623091","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not suitable for all ages or for viewing at work: frequent violence, gore, and general mature content."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distant future. The world is run by megacorporations, crises end to be followed by another one. To reign in the growing social tension a decision was made to reanimate a long forgotten form of entertainment, the gladiator fights. Ancient traditions enhanced by hi-tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the gladiators lucky enough to join NCORE. What awaits you on the way to glory?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic PvPvE fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 