pan class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/extras/d92e282c2bb4a2044bd2a1a3778d8e2e.poster.avif?t=1770623091\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/extras/d92e282c2bb4a2044bd2a1a3778d8e2e.webm?t=1770623091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/extras/d92e282c2bb4a2044bd2a1a3778d8e2e.mp4?t=1770623091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your arsenal is the peak of technology. Weapons transform from long-ranged to melee in a blink \u2013 from a rifle to a mace, shotgun to sword, pistol to claws. Use each mode strategically to dominate the arena.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Teamwork</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/extras/726895c3b95746ed802f60401da4874b.poster.avif?t=1770623091\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/extras/726895c3b95746ed802f60401da4874b.webm?t=1770623091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/extras/726895c3b95746ed802f60401da4874b.mp4?t=1770623091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join teams of up to three gladiators and act as a unit, or split up and rely on each other\u2019s mastery. Be flexible in your tactics, crash your opponents, and lead your team to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join NCORE. Test the futuristic arena and become the hero worthy of their own legend!</p>","developers":["Astrum Oyun"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Sezam (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307770/56c0fbe449e3680cbe1f0abd13824012574107b3/header.jpg?t=1770623091","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3307770/649734653/d881070f66058453f757fee351165ae81d3b28db/1755071894/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755185306","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3307770/649734653/d881070f66058453f757fee351165ae81d3b28db/1755071894/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755185306","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3307770/649734653/d881070f66058453f757fee351165ae81d3b28db/1755071894/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755185306","id":257182495,"name":"NCORE Alpha Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257182495/fa8dc645ea36c8382673109e44059c79f9a355b4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755185306"}],"name":"NCORE","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4670k / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1080 / AMD RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 80 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> An SSD is strongly recommended; the listed requirements target 1080p at 30 FPS.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8600 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600 or higher